			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140040201,
					"content": "曾經以為「梅洛彼得堡」會很可怕，現在想想氣氛其實也還不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040202,
					"content": "生活穩定，每天都有飯吃，能用「特許券」買各式各樣的東西，難怪很多犯人不願意離開。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040203,
						140040204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040203,
					"content": "的確如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040205,
					"content": "#哦，{F#妳}{M#你}在說萊歐斯利啊，我也覺得他是個很有本事的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040206,
					"content": "雖然看起來有點嚴肅，但實際接觸了之後，感覺也滿好說話的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040207,
					"content": "不知道他對這裡的人是什麼樣的態度，難道說，因人而異？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040208,
					"content": "沒有一點手段是不行的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040209,
					"content": "嗯，能讓這裡的人都守規矩，又不顯得壓抑，他一定有獨到的管理經驗吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040210,
					"content": "#請問，有人在嗎？求求{F#妳}{M#你}們幫我一個忙好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040211,
					"content": "欸？我剛剛是不是聽到了什麼聲音？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040212,
					"content": "我好像也…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040213,
					"content": "請問，有人路過嗎？可不可以幫我一個忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040214,
					"content": "確實，沒有聽錯，在這邊！但沒看到人啊，怎麼會…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040215,
					"content": "啊，是有人聽到嗎？妳好，在這邊，箱子裡面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040216,
					"content": "#箱子？難怪沒看到人。唉，{NICKNAME}，我們過去看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040217,
					"content": "你幹嘛要躲在箱子裡啊，要是沒人路過，不管你喊多久都是白費力氣哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040218,
					"content": "呃，原因比較複雜，可以先不追究嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040219,
						140040220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040219,
					"content": "難道是眉毛被人剃掉了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040221,
					"content": "嗚哇，好過分，你是被霸凌了嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040222,
					"content": "不是不是，沒有那麼嚴重，我只是想讓人幫我找一下我的帽子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040223,
					"content": "只是帽子而已？那為什麼要躲起來？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040224,
					"content": "哦，我懂了！你的頭髮是不是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040225,
						140040226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040225,
					"content": "派蒙，別問了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040227
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040227,
					"content": "對不起、對不起。我明白了，原來是這樣啊，嘿嘿，難怪你不願意見人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040228,
					"content": "帽子對吧，我們馬上就去幫你找回來。它長什麼樣子呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040229,
					"content": "#感覺{F#妳}{M#你}們誤會了什麼，但是…唉，算了，只要能把帽子找回來就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040230,
					"content": "那是一頂帶簷的軟帽子，棕色，樣式比較普通。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040231,
					"content": "大概就掉在入口的升降平臺附近。因為有點熱，我取下帽子休息了一會，回過神來它就不見了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040232,
					"content": "#拜託{F#妳}{M#你}們了，帽子對我很重要，我就在這裡等{F#妳}{M#你}們回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "費索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040233,
					"content": "放心吧，去去就回。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040226,
					"content": "派蒙，留點面子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040227
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040220,
					"content": "難道是衣服被人撕壞了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040204,
					"content": "這大概就是那個人的管理風格。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040205
					]
				}
			]
		},
