				{
					"id": 140040702,
					"content": "哈哈哈，埃爾瓦德大哥去進貨了，這時候通常就讓我來顧攤子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040703,
					"content": "等一下，金髮的外國人，加上一隻會飛的白色薑餅人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040704,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們就是傳說中的旅行者和得力搭檔派蒙吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040705,
					"content": "對！…欸不對！呃，半對不對？我是想說，我不是什麼薑餅人，我是得力搭檔派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040706,
					"content": "抱歉抱歉，直到現在才有機會一睹真容，太激動了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040707,
					"content": "要是有什麼說錯話的地方，還請多多擔待，不要跟我這樣的小人物計較。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040708,
					"content": "啊，也沒必要一下子這麼客氣，我只是吐槽而已…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040709,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們在伊黎耶島做的那些事，早就傳到梅洛彼得堡了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040710,
					"content": "#前段時間聽說{F#妳}{M#你}們來到了這裡，還被公爵大人親自接待，我們都很羨慕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040711,
					"content": "#現在誰都知道{F#妳}{M#你}們是公爵大人身邊的紅人，都希望能結識一下呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040712,
						140040713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040712,
					"content": "原來是因為他…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040714
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040714,
					"content": "哈哈，與其用謊言來拍馬屁，我覺得還是坦誠一點比較好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040715,
					"content": "當初我就是聽說埃爾瓦德大哥好像和公爵大人關係不一般，才主動說要來幫他顧店。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040716,
					"content": "結果這麼久過去了，公爵大人我沒見過兩次，倒是和大哥成了很好的朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040717,
					"content": "誰做事沒有目的呢，但目的是否能實現，也不能強求嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040718,
					"content": "所以你又看上我們了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040719,
					"content": "#一碼歸一碼，能碰見{F#妳}{M#你}們，本來就是我的榮幸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040720,
					"content": "#對了，{F#妳}{M#你}們想要什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040721,
					"content": "男士的帽子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040722
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040722,
					"content": "沒問題，還有其他的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040723,
					"content": "隨便挑吧，不用擔心「特許券」，都由我來買單。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040724,
					"content": "那怎麼行，太不好意思了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040725,
					"content": "哎呀，反正大哥也不發我工資，每次就讓我挑一些看得上的東西帶回去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040726,
					"content": "#我最近也不缺什麼，不如送給{F#妳}{M#你}們，交個朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040727,
					"content": "都說到這個份上了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040728
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040728,
					"content": "那、那我挑挑看吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040729,
					"content": "一陣猶豫之後，派蒙很克制地挑選了兩種點心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040730
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040730,
					"content": "真的不再選一點嗎？這種機會很難得哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040731,
					"content": "不用啦，這樣就夠了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040732,
					"content": "妳也有不想佔便宜的時候。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040733
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040733,
					"content": "佔便宜和隨便拿不一樣，還是佔便宜更開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040734,
					"content": "#算了，聊這個話題就太複雜了，那個人還在等我們呢。下次再和{F#妳}{M#你}介紹派蒙心理學。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040735,
					"content": "謝謝你，那我們就先走啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040736,
					"content": "好的，謝謝惠顧！記得在公爵大人那裡給「破爛骨頭商店」一個好評哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尚博迪克"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040737,
					"content": "這種要好評的方式真狡猾啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040713,
					"content": "我還以為是個人魅力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040714
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1400408,
